zaino --worktree login: `--worktree` supports new interactive sessions, `zaino fork`, `zaino exec`, and `zaino exec fork`
zaino fork --worktree: `zaino fork --worktree` requires an explicit session ID
zaino fork --worktree --last: `zaino fork --worktree` requires an explicit session ID
zaino exec resume --worktree session: `--worktree` cannot resume an existing session; use `zaino exec fork --worktree`
zaino exec review --worktree: `--worktree` is not supported for code review
zaino resume --worktree session: `--worktree` supports new interactive sessions, `zaino fork`, `zaino exec`, and `zaino exec fork`
zaino archive session --worktree: `--worktree` supports new interactive sessions, `zaino fork`, `zaino exec`, and `zaino exec fork`
zaino queue --thread session --message hi --worktree: `--worktree` supports new interactive sessions, `zaino fork`, `zaino exec`, and `zaino exec fork`
